<div class="mm-brand"><span class="hanko">商</span><span class="wordmark">Akin<span class="wm-ai">ai</span></span></div>
<a class="mm-link" href="#payments">Payments</a>
<a class="mm-link" href="#reconciliation">Bank import</a>
<a class="mm-link" href="#estimates">Estimates</a>
<a class="mm-link" href="#global">Global</a>
<a class="mm-link" href="#pricing">Pricing</a>
<a class="mm-link" href="#faq">FAQ</a>
<div class="mm-act"><a class="signin" href="account/login">Sign in</a><a class="btn btn-ink" href="account/register">Get started</a></div>
</div>

<!-- hero -->
<div class="hero">
<div class="wrap" style="max-width:1088px">
<span class="eyebrow">Invoicing for freelancers with clients abroad</span>
<h1 class="h1">Bill in their currency.<br><span class="thin">Report in</span> <span class="em">yours.</span></h1>
<div class="herohair">
<div>
<p class="lead">Akinai is invoicing software for people billing clients in more than one country. One in euros, one in dong, one in won — each gets an invoice in their own language and currency. Your dashboard adds it all up in yours.</p>
<div class="herocta"><a class="btn btn-ink btn-lg" href="account/register">Start for free<svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 7l5 5m0 0l-5 5m5-5H6"></path></svg></a></div>
<div class="spec"><div class="si"><div class="sn">8</div><div class="sl">Languages</div></div><div class="si"><div class="sn">5<span class="u"> ways to pay</span></div><div class="sl">Bank · PayPal · Wise · Revolut · VietQR</div></div><div class="si"><div class="sn">Auto</div><div class="sl">Payments matched</div></div></div>
</div>
<div class="speccell"><span class="fig">INV — 0231 / VND</span>
<div class="cardwrap">
<div class="card">
<div class="chead"><div class="fx ac gap12"><span class="clogo">DS</span><div><div class="cname">Delta Studio</div><div class="cloc">HO CHI MINH CITY · VN</div></div></div><div class="cstat"><span class="spill sp-await"><span class="sd" style="background:oklch(.5 .11 70)"></span>Awaiting</span><span class="spill sp-paid"><span class="sd" style="background:oklch(.48 .11 155)"></span>Paid</span></div></div>
<div class="cbody"><div class="fx ac gap8 wrap"><span class="lab">Billed to</span><span class="co">Anh Minh Co.</span><span class="vi">TIẾNG VIỆT · VND</span></div><div class="amtlab">Total · settles in their currency</div><div class="amtroll-wrap"><div class="amtroll"><div class="amtrow">₫68,000,000</div><div class="amtrow">$1,850.00</div><div class="amtrow">€2,480.00</div><div class="amtrow">£1,200.00</div><div class="amtrow">₫68,000,000</div></div></div></div>
<div class="cpay"><div class="qrwrap"><span class="qrbox"><svg width="60" height="60" viewBox="0 0 80 80" fill="none"><rect x="4" y="4" width="20" height="20" rx="2" stroke="#1a1712" stroke-width="4"/><rect x="12" y="12" width="4" height="4" fill="#1a1712"/><rect x="56" y="4" width="20" height="20" rx="2" stroke="#1a1712" stroke-width="4"/><rect x="64" y="12" width="4" height="4" fill="#1a1712"/><rect x="4" y="56" width="20" height="20" rx="2" stroke="#1a1712" stroke-width="4"/><rect x="12" y="64" width="4" height="4" fill="#1a1712"/><g fill="#1a1712"><rect x="32" y="4" width="6" height="6"/><rect x="42" y="4" width="6" height="6"/><rect x="32" y="14" width="6" height="6"/><rect x="4" y="32" width="6" height="6"/><rect x="14" y="32" width="6" height="6"/><rect x="34" y="32" width="6" height="6"/><rect x="54" y="32" width="6" height="6"/><rect x="70" y="32" width="6" height="6"/><rect x="32" y="52" width="6" height="6"/><rect x="52" y="52" width="6" height="6"/></g></svg><span class="beam"></span></span><div><div class="rname">Scan to pay</div><div class="rsub">VIETQR · OPENS BANKING APP</div></div></div><div class="paidwrap"><div class="rsub" style="margin-top:9px;letter-spacing:.06em">PAID VIA VIETQR · 27 JUN 2026</div></div></div>
</div></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>

</div>

<!-- Proof.

     Sits directly after the hero, where the problem section used to. The hero
     makes a claim about currency and language; this is the claim being true,
     one click away, before any feature is described. -->
<div id="global" class="sec"><div class="wrap" style="text-align:center">
<span class="seyebrow">AI translation</span>
<h2 class="stt">The invoice arrives already in their language</h2>
<p class="sdd" style="margin:16px auto 0">Pick a client. The document redraws in their language, currency, date format and payment methods.</p>

<div style="margin-top:38px">
<LocalizedInvoiceDemo />
</div>

<div class="aisplit">
<div class="aicol">
<div class="aikind">Written in, not translated</div>
<p class="aip">Subtotal, Amount Due, Bill To — every heading is set per language in the app. Always the term a local accountant expects, and free.</p>
</div>
<div class="aicol">
<div class="aikind">Translated by AI</div>
<p class="aip">Your job descriptions, notes and terms. Cached, so the same phrase is paid for once, and capped per month so it cannot run away.</p>
</div>
</div>

<p class="sdd" style="margin:44px auto 0">And four templates to choose the look.</p>
<div class="fx gap12" style="margin-top:30px;flex-wrap:wrap"><div class="tmpl"><div class="tmplbar" style="background:var(--ink)"></div><div class="tmplbody"><div class="tmplname">Minimal</div><div class="tmpltag">Clean · mono</div></div></div><div class="tmpl"><div class="tmplbar" style="background:var(--shu)"></div><div class="tmplbody"><div class="tmplname">Professional</div><div class="tmpltag">Default</div></div></div><div class="tmpl"><div class="tmplbar" style="background:var(--ai)"></div><div class="tmplbody"><div class="tmplname">Modern</div><div class="tmpltag">Bold accent</div></div></div><div class="tmpl"><div class="tmplbar" style="background:oklch(.42 .03 60)"></div><div class="tmplbody"><div class="tmplname">Classic</div><div class="tmpltag">Traditional</div></div></div></div>
</div></div>

<!-- Reporting currency.

     Directly after the demo because the two are one idea seen from both ends:
     the demo is what the client receives, this is what the owner reads back. -->
<div id="reporting" class="sec sec-alt"><div class="wrap"><div class="fsec">
<div>
<span class="seyebrow">Reporting</span>
<h2 class="stt">Six currencies out, one number back</h2>
<p class="sdd">Invoice in whatever your client pays in. Your dashboard, reports and cash flow all read in the one currency you think in.</p>
<div class="bullet"><svg class="bk" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path></svg>Converted at the rate on the day you raised it</div>
<div class="bullet"><svg class="bk" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path></svg>So March still says what it said in March</div>
</div>
<div class="panel">
<div class="convhead">Q2 · reported in GBP</div>
<div class="convrows">
<div class="convrow"><span class="convcur">VND</span><span class="convamt">₫68,000,000</span><span class="convarrow">→</span><span class="convgbp">£2,040</span></div>
<div class="convrow"><span class="convcur">EUR</span><span class="convamt">€2,480</span><span class="convarrow">→</span><span class="convgbp">£2,108</span></div>
<div class="convrow"><span class="convcur">USD</span><span class="convamt">$1,850</span><span class="convarrow">→</span><span class="convgbp">£1,388</span></div>
<div class="convrow"><span class="convcur">KRW</span><span class="convamt">₩2,400,000</span><span class="convarrow">→</span><span class="convgbp">£1,332</span></div>
</div>
<div class="convtotal"><span>Total invoiced</span><span class="convbig">£6,868</span></div>
</div>
</div></div></div>

